        "line": 695,
        "text": "theorem radialProfile_source_formula (h τ r : ℝ) :\n    radialProfile (1 + h) τ r =\n      (r ^ 2 / 2) ^ (-(1 / 2 + h)) * profile (1 + h) (2 * τ / (r ^ 2 / 2))"
